<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on Swiss ABB bearer shares.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on Swiss ABB bearer shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it had issued two million American-style call warrants, on ABB Asea Brown Boveri bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1600 CHF		  PREMIUM	8.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.10 CHF		  GEARING	13.10 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.NOV.96-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1590 CHF</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
